5. Theoretical Benefits
	•	Family Empowerment: Families could influence reintegration through lawful pre-planning.
	•	Skill Continuity: Participants might acquire pre-release certifications that translate into post-release labor.
	•	Community Ownership: Hypothetical cooperatives could foster local infrastructure development.
	•	Income-Generating Opportunities: Solar and mining operations could potentially create cooperative income streams.
	•	Replicability: Conceptual framework could be adapted to other states or communities.

